'''Exorcists''' are enemies found exclusively in the fight against {{E|The Heretic}}, and can never be found naturally. They take the appearance of a {{E|Gaper}} with its head's skin rolled down, revealing its skull.

If spawned by itself, it will start to walk towards Isaac, occasionally spawning a single {{E|Lil' Haunt}}. It will try to follow the most recently spawned {{E|Lil' Haunt}} and use it to shield itself, and it will only spawn another Lil' Haunt once the previous one has been killed. It will also run away from Isaac once its designated Lil Haunt has been killed prior to spawning another.

After an enemy dies, it will leave behind a small red spirit, sometimes, an Exorcist will walk over to one of the red spirits and revive it as a {{E|Lil' Haunt}}, similar to {{E|Rag Man}} or a {{E|Cultist}}. These red spirits are the same ones created by {{I|Vade Retro}} and can be blown up as such. All red spirits will disappear once an exorcist dies unless holding {{I|Vade Retro}}.

=== Notes ===
* The only method to kill the shielded Exorcists in The Heretic's fight is with {{p|Chaos Card}}, {{i|Little Horn}}, {{i|Euthanasia}}, or {{I|Suplex!}} as they go through shields.
{{clear}}

== Variations ==
